## AUR package

`packaging/aur/herdr-sixel/PKGBUILD` builds this fork as the Arch User
Repository package `herdr-sixel`. It pins Zig 0.16.0 because the vendored
`libghostty-vt` does not build with the Zig that Arch currently ships.
